{"study_accession":"PRJNA558253","secondary_study_accession":"SRP217136","title":"Transcriptomic analysis of freshly purified human CD226- and CD226+ CD8+ T cell subsets isolated from the peripheral blood of healthy donors.","description":"We recently found that loss of the activating receptor CD226 (DNAM-1) was a critical mechanism affecting CD8+ T cell responsiveness to TCR stimulation. To better understand the molecular differences between CD226- and CD226+ CD8+ T cells, we decided to perform a global transcriptional analysis of purified naive (Tn, CD62L+CD45RA+), central memory (Tcm, CD62L+CD45RA-) and terminal effector memory (Temra, CD62L-CD45RA+) CD226+ and CD226- CD8+ T cells using next generation RNA sequencing. Overall design: Total RNA was extracted using RNeasy Micro kit (QIAGEN) and the sequencing was performed using next generation RNA sequencing","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":20,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN12431202","study_accession":"PRJNA558253","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"47-Tn-CD226-PLUS","description":"47-Tn-CD226-PLUS","sex":"female","geo_sample":"GSM4002831","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2020-10-31","attributes":[["source_name","Tn CD226+"],["sex","female"],["collection_date","2016-06-01"],["tissue","peripheral blood"],["cell_type","Tn CD226+"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR9888361","experiment_accession":"SRX6640778","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":7437664,"base_count":1123128009,"first_public":"2020-10-31","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM4002831: 47-Tn-CD226-PLUS Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN12431203","study_accession":"PRJNA558253","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"41-Tn-CD226-PLUS","description":"41-Tn-CD226-PLUS","sex":"male","geo_sample":"GSM4002830","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2020-1